Unreleased
==========

  - changed: the socket and feedback ports listen on 127.0.0.1 unless told
    otherwise; they listened on every address of the machine. A controller on
    another host now needs `-b <address>` (`--bind-address`), `-b 0.0.0.0` for
    every address, or MOD_DEVICE_HOST_BIND_ADDRESS for a JACK internal client.
  - new: socket_set_bind_address() in libmod-host-protocol, called before
    socket_start().

0.10.8
======

  - fix: the protocol's command table holds 128 commands, and one past them is
    refused with -1 and named on stderr instead of dropped in silence; a host
    registering 65 lost quit (#6, offered upstream as mod-audio/mod-host#116)
  - new: libFuzzer harnesses for the protocol layer, with a recorded mutant
    and input for each check (#4, #5)

0.10.7
======

  - new: the socket server, protocol and command dispatch as an opt-in shared
    library, libmod-host-protocol.so.0: `make lib` builds it, `make install-lib`
    installs it with its headers and mod-host-protocol.pc (#107)
  - new: the effect verbs registered through a backend interface; a backend
    can answer monitor_output and send output_set (#105, #108)
  - new: param_info, remote_pages and track_info (#109)
  - new: `add` can name its JACK client (#101)
  - new: socket protocol tests that need no JACK (#106)
  - fix: socket input is split into NUL-terminated commands (#113)
  - fix: any number of spaces between protocol words (#81); trimming spaces
    no longer reads before an empty string (#112)
  - fix: the missing -t short option (#82)
  - fix: three crashes found running a large plugin catalog (#100); a heap
    overread on a zero-size Path property (#98)

0.10.5
======

  - new: lv2 presets support

0.10.4
======
  - new: cpu_load information

0.10.3
======
  - fix: sampleRate property implementation

0.10.2
======
  - fix: calculates bounds when the port has the sampleRate property

0.10.1
======

  - fix: checking last modified parameter

0.10
====

  - new: man pages files
  - new: control set parameter optimization
  - new: documentation and autocomplete to monitor command
  - fix: command print in verbose mode

0.9
